  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiKRZsq7NQfFsOmlpu2mB73PGoPKtX2iQbvLwt3Kmig1EMCnamIpCyJe9T5imdlxQ6SYhZj0wOhIqS1KUEjZpF5GhDqf6V4ZIm6aV-gYezh3iWbaGheEIm226WLDND5iazFdqTkvf498Ld-asFGk_2GiALhbZbJ-YR3m-OWce948LQxdE2hggloRTZFsg/s1424/341%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiKRZsq7NQfFsOmlpu2mB73PGoPKtX2iQbvLwt3Kmig1EMCnamIpCyJe9T5imdlxQ6SYhZj0wOhIqS1KUEjZpF5GhDqf6V4ZIm6aV-gYezh3iWbaGheEIm226WLDND5iazFdqTkvf498Ld-asFGk_2GiALhbZbJ-YR3m-OWce948LQxdE2hggloRTZFsg/w450-h640/341%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><p></p><h3 style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2022/09/bong341.html\" target=\"_blank\">封面作品</a><br /><br /></span></h3><h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2022/09/341e.html\" target=\"_blank\">編輯室ê話</a><br /><br /></span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">做伙來唸詩</span></h3><div style=\"text-align: center;\">陳昭蓉<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2022/09/blog-post.html\" target=\"_blank\">天后宮天后聖母</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>1</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">何明洲<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2022/09/blog-post_6.html\" target=\"_blank\">長濱</a></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">2</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">崎仔頭赤子<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/09/peh.html\" target=\"_blank\">我思　peh百年烏松</a></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">3</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">顏銘俊<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/09/sio.html\" target=\"_blank\">Sio借問</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>4</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">謝函傑<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2022/09/e.html\" target=\"_blank\">大坪頂、小港，我ê愛</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>40</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><br /></div><h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阿瑞--ā話仙</span></h3><div style=\"text-align: center;\">藍春瑞<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/09/e_8.html\" target=\"_blank\">阿母ê老款</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>7</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><br /></div><h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">文學káng「台」</span></h3><div style=\"text-align: center;\">石牧民<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/09/ekhah.html\" target=\"_blank\">看無台文ê人看台文khah無</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>8</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><br /></div><h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">台語sa攏有講座</span></h3><div style=\"text-align: center;\">主講／林杏佳&nbsp;</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">記錄／白鎔維<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/09/ui-alphaomicron-e.html\" target=\"_blank\">Uì Alpha到Omicron：新冠肺炎橫逆ê時代</a><br />10</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><br /></div><h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">農民食堂</span></h3><div style=\"text-align: center;\">主講／林大米</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 黃建圖</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 林沛慈</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 蔡茹米</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">記錄／田永承<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/09/lan_12.html\" target=\"_blank\">行，lán去龜山島樂園！</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>12</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><br /></div><h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">光景bóng uē</span></h3><div style=\"text-align: center;\">陳智銘<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/09/blog-post_12.html\" target=\"_blank\">故鄉</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>14</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><br /></div><h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">逐家來phò-tāu</span></h3><div style=\"text-align: center;\">陳春美<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/09/seh-seh.html\" target=\"_blank\">Se̍h-se̍h唸</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>18</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">林阿猴<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/09/e_12.html\" target=\"_blank\">初學日本舞ê經驗分享</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>20</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">蔡逸民<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/09/e_13.html\" target=\"_blank\">我ê台語家庭經驗</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>42</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><br /></div><h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">醫學台文</span></h3><div style=\"text-align: center;\">羅九安<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/09/uetiann-tiann-e.html\" target=\"_blank\">是按怎uè著新冠病毒tiānn-tiānn ē鼻無芳臭？</a></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>22</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><br /></div><h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Lán來講看māi</span></h3><div style=\"text-align: center;\">陳育萱<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/09/e_6.html\" target=\"_blank\">聽總統府台語導覽了後寫ê一張批</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>24</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><br /></div><h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">地名研究室</span></h3><div style=\"text-align: center;\">黃偉嘉<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/09/tsioh-siong.html\" target=\"_blank\">石像（Tsio̍h-siōng）</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>27</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><br /></div><h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">台灣人寫真</span></h3><div style=\"text-align: center;\">李瓊麗<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/09/blog-post_13.html\" target=\"_blank\">新婦仔命</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>28</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">田美瑜<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/09/tshe-e.html\" target=\"_blank\">魚鱗tshè ê記憶</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>30</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><br /></div><h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">心內話</span></h3><div style=\"text-align: center;\">黃明勝<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/09/hit.html\" target=\"_blank\">八八風災hit幾日</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>32</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">Ngôo Ka-hun<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2022/09/ehoo.html\" target=\"_blank\">「支援--ê」——寫hōo台語伴</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>33</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><br /></div><h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">生活ê藝術</span></h3><div style=\"text-align: center;\">張寶明<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/09/ah.html\" target=\"_blank\">桃花死--ah</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>39</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><br /></div><h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">寫hō͘學生朋友ê代誌</span></h3><div style=\"text-align: center;\">陳雷<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/09/e_15.html\" target=\"_blank\">科學ê奇境</a></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/09/e_15.html\" target=\"_blank\">Kho-ha̍k ê Kî-kéng</a></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">44</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">李江却台語文教基金會捐款徵信</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre;\">\t</span>2022年7--月<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">\t</span>46</div><div><br /></div></span></div><div><span><span><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span><a name='more'></a></span><div><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhCmIBSKo6UDX8IApqA62i4fL2ZRhqVxtqlkkmhUK7pwLgSHudvAIUQuTRSFWYgypTQBRSo8LGGUNAxv4U_Y3ukccGoT_T5v7lYs7s0dBQavNqg5fbS-J_6mB9T4ncjSXsAraRVFQFRTNI9bB0jcXyeC_G3-fuFZ6-7XrMTT-EbpG20tsGYhY2cnMdhvg/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1341%E6%9C%9F_%E7%9B%AE%E9%8C%84.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhCmIBSKo6UDX8IApqA62i4fL2ZRhqVxtqlkkmhUK7pwLgSHudvAIUQuTRSFWYgypTQBRSo8LGGUNAxv4U_Y3ukccGoT_T5v7lYs7s0dBQavNqg5fbS-J_6mB9T4ncjSXsAraRVFQFRTNI9bB0jcXyeC_G3-fuFZ6-7XrMTT-EbpG20tsGYhY2cnMdhvg/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1341%E6%9C%9F_%E7%9B%AE%E9%8C%84.jpg\" width=\"45